                  className="w-full border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-indigo-500/10 focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-none border bg-slate-50 text-sm font-medium" 
                  placeholder="Record what happened during the follow-up call..."
